{"_id":"696650013eeddc26d7c3ad89","roadmapSlug":"ruby","nodeId":"B5T4d3FYTvydh4DOcTFFR","description":"# Regular Expressions in Ruby\n\nRegular expressions (regex) are patterns used to match character combinations in strings. In Ruby, you can use regex to search, replace, or validate text within strings. They are defined using forward slashes (`/pattern/`) or the `%r{pattern}` syntax and provide a powerful way to manipulate and analyze text data based on specific patterns.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"class Regexp","url":"https://docs.ruby-lang.org/en/master/Regexp.html","_id":"6a7f4b2bcb44947debcfd85a"},{"type":"article","title":"Mastering Ruby Regular Expressions","url":"https://www.rubyguides.com/2015/06/ruby-regex/","_id":"6a7f4b2bcb44947debcfd85b"},{"type":"article","title":"Regular Expressions","url":"https://ruby-for-beginners.rubymonstas.org/advanced/regular_expressions.html","_id":"6a7f4b2bcb44947debcfd85c"},{"type":"article","title":"Cool Ruby regex tricks","url":"https://www.honeybadger.io/blog/ruby-regex-tricks/","_id":"6a7f4b2bcb44947debcfd85d"},{"type":"video","title":"Ruby for Newbies: Regular Expressions","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hy6KUoU34_w","_id":"6a7f4b2bcb44947debcfd85e"},{"type":"video","title":"Ruby Programming Tutorial - 23 - Beginning Regular Expressions","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q70q-QyIios","_id":"6a7f4b2bcb44947debcfd85f"}],"createdAt":"2026-01-13T14:00:33.081Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:06:51.273Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/ruby/content/B5T4d3FYTvydh4DOcTFFR.md"}